TEXT -184 360 Left 2 ;You can see that the values are the same for matlab and ltspice\nDont forget to change rkessel to the same value as matlab\nNote that the flux value of phase 1 is 2 times flux_rated\nTherefore the current is high (~700A)\nBe aware that if the flux is not exact of the one of the value pairs\nof matlab saturation curve the resulted simulated current will be different\nbetween matlab and ltspice (The curve of ltspice is computed by the formula:\nI=Imue*(a*(PHI/phiN)+(1-a)*(PHI/phiN)^m) which is a continues curve not \na piecewise linear curve.
TEXT -32 112 Left 2 ;See matlab file: Trafo_malab_pu_and_Si_2_saturation_900MW.slx and see\nTrafo_matlab_pu_SI_900MW.mlx
